<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Oferta Especial $7 USD - 30 Días Sin Estrés</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts: Sora -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Sora', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            primary: {
              DEFAULT: '#0b7a7c',
              dark: '#085e60',
              light: '#e2f7ff',
            },
            coral: {
              DEFAULT: '#f06449',
              hover: '#e05338',
              light: '#ffebe6',
            },
            surface: {
              bg: '#f1fbff',
              card: '#ffffff',
              soft: '#e9f8fd',
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
      background-color: #f1fbff;
      color: #1e293b;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex justify-center bg-[#f1fbff] p-0 sm:py-6 selection:bg-[#0b7a7c] selection:text-white">

  <!-- Mobile Frame Container (Max width 420px for perfect mobile simulation) -->
  <main class="w-full max-w-[420px] bg-white min-h-screen shadow-xl sm:rounded-3xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden border border-slate-100">
    
    <!-- Top App Bar Navigation -->
    <header class="px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fdff] sticky top-0 z-30">
      <button onclick="window.history.back()" aria-label="Cerrar" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
        </svg>
      </button>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-[#0b7a7c] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">
          30
        </div>
        <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-800 tracking-tight">30 Días Sin Estrés</span>
      </div>

      <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#0b7a7c]/10 text-[#0b7a7c] flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7 7z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <div class="flex-1 p-5 space-y-6 overflow-y-auto">

      <!-- Launch Badge & Hero Title -->
      <div class="text-center space-y-2">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#e2f7ff] text-[#0b7a7c] text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase border border-[#0b7a7c]/20">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
          Oferta de Lanzamiento • Acceso de por vida
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
          Empieza hoy tu camino hacia la calma
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
          Acceso inmediato al programa completo de 30 días.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Course Summary Card -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0b7a7c] to-[#085e60] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-inner">
            🌱
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#0b7a7c] uppercase">Programa Digital Guiado</span>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">30 Días Sin Estrés</h2>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Bienestar y paz financiera paso a paso</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-700">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-[10px]">✓</span>
            <span><strong>30 lecciones diarias guiadas</strong> (menos de 10 min al día)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-[10px]">✓</span>
            <span>Herramientas prácticas de hábitos y dinero sin estrés</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-[10px]">✓</span>
            <span>Acceso ilimitado y a tu propio ritmo para siempre</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-[10px]">✓</span>
            <span>Garantía total de satisfacción por 7 días</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pricing Highlight Card ($7 USD) -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e0f7fe] to-[#ecfafe] rounded-2xl p-4 border border-[#0b7a7c]/20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#0b7a7c] uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          Inversión Única con 74% de Descuento
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 my-1">
          <span class="text-base text-slate-400 line-through font-semibold">$27 USD</span>
          <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0b7a7c] tracking-tight">$7 USD</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[#ffebe6] text-[#f06449] font-bold text-xs">Ahorras $20</span>
        </div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/80 border border-white text-slate-600 text-[11px] font-medium mt-2">
          <span>🌿</span> Solo ~$0.23 USD al día. Sin cargos mensuales ni suscripciones.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Access Form & Payment Options -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">Datos para tu acceso</h3>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-emerald-600 flex items-center gap-1 font-medium">
            <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
            </svg>
            Seguro
          </span>
        </div>

        <form id="checkout-form" class="space-y-3" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Redirigiendo a Hotmart Checkout...');">
          <!-- Full Name -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1" for="name">Tu nombre completo</label>
            <div class="relative">
              <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="Ej. Ana Lucía Morales" 
                class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 text-xs bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-[#0b7a7c] focus:bg-white transition-all text-slate-800">
              <span class="absolute left-3.5 top-3 text-slate-400 text-xs">👤</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Email -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1" for="email">Correo electrónico (donde recibirás el acceso)</label>
            <div class="relative">
              <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="tucorreo@ejemplo.com" 
                class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 text-xs bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-[#0b7a7c] focus:bg-white transition-all text-slate-800">
              <span class="absolute left-3.5 top-3 text-slate-400 text-xs">✉️</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Payment Methods Selector -->
          <div class="pt-2 space-y-2">
            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">Selecciona tu método preferido</label>

            <!-- Card -->
            <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#0b7a7c] bg-[#e2f7ff]/40 cursor-pointer transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <input type="radio" name="payment" value="card" checked class="w-4 h-4 text-[#0b7a7c] focus:ring-[#0b7a7c]">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800">Tarjeta Débito / Crédito</div>
                  <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Visa, Mastercard, Amex</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="text-base">💳</span>
            </label>

            <!-- PayPal -->
            <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 bg-white cursor-pointer transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <input type="radio" name="payment" value="paypal" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#0b7a7c] focus:ring-[#0b7a7c]">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800">PayPal</div>
                  <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Pago rápido en 1 clic</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#003087]">PayPal</span>
            </label>

            <!-- Local Cash / Google Pay -->
            <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 bg-white cursor-pointer transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <input type="radio" name="payment" value="local" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#0b7a7c] focus:ring-[#0b7a7c]">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800">Pago local / Efectivo</div>
                  <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">OXXO, Efecty, Baloto, según tu país</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="text-base">🏪</span>
            </label>
          </div>

          <!-- Trust Badges -->
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl space-y-2 border border-slate-100 text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600">🔒</span>
              <span>Pago 100% Seguro cifrado SSL de 256 bits</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-500">🛡️</span>
              <span>Garantía incondicional de 7 días (devolución del 100%)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amber-500">⭐</span>
              <span>Plataforma oficial y procesador seguro Hotmart</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Primary CTA Button -->
          <div class="pt-3">
            <!-- NOTA: Reemplaza '#' en href con tu enlace directo de checkout de Hotmart -->
            <a href="https://pay.hotmart.com/TU_CODIGO_DE_CHECKOUT" 
               target="_blank"
               class="w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f06449] hover:bg-[#e05338] text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-[#f06449]/30 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all transform active:scale-[0.99] text-center block">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Obtener acceso completo por $7 USD</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div class="text-center space-y-1.5 pt-1 pb-4">
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">
            Al hacer clic serás redirigido al procesador seguro de Hotmart. Recibirás tus datos de acceso al instante por email.
          </p>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
            <span>🛡️ Compra protegida</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>Sin riesgo</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>Soporte 24/7</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
